      "question": "How is this different from just taking HGH?",
      "answer": "Exogenous HGH bypasses your pituitary and delivers a fixed pharmacological dose \u2014 your body&#x27;s own feedback system doesn&#x27;t get a say. CJC-1295 and ipamorelin work upstream, stimulating your pituitary to produce GH through its own machinery. That means somatostatin (your body&#x27;s GH brake) stays in the loop, which is thought to produce a more physiologic pattern and a milder side effect profile. It&#x27;s also a legally cleaner pathway \u2014 compounded HGH is more tightly regulated than these secretagogues."
